<title>USA: Ohio jobless rate dips slightly in October.</title>
<headline>Ohio jobless rate dips slightly in October.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>- Ohio's seasonally adjusted unemployment rate for October dipped slightly to 4.7 percent from 4.8 percent in September, the state's bureau of employment services reported Friday.</p>
<p>--Karen Pierog, 312-408-8647</p>
</text>
